{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11205310","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11205310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120531001:1":{"text":"새들을 전부 풀어줬어요. 다행이다!","source_cn":"鸟儿都不在笼子里了，真好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09997CB45F7595EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120531002:1":{"text":"아슬아슬했어요! 다행히 페토가 경매장으로 쳐들어가는 바람에 일이 수월하게 풀렸어요.","source_cn":"好险！还好帕托突然闯入拍卖会场，这才让黑金措手不及，来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DE85D56AFFF54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120531003:1":{"text":"치피도 아무런 준비 없이 있다가, 깜짝 놀랐지 뭐예요!","source_cn":"满满也完全没有准备，被吓了一跳呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2BC8E2A9F922F6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120531004:1":{"text":"페토는 저랑 사냥할 때 호흡이 아주 잘 맞아요!","source_cn":"帕托和我抓猎物时，配合很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5185838E7A2D09FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120531005:1":{"text":"한 명이 돌진하면, 한 명은 길을 막죠! 이젠 척하면 척이죠!","source_cn":"一个冲出去，一个去堵路！它能明白我的意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD02D34FDD14EDE46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120531006:2":{"text":"우오…","source_cn":"呜嗷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0410B6048E0F20AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120531007:2":{"text":"쿠와앙!!","source_cn":"吼嗷嗷！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x876268DCB55CDDA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120531007":{"text":"쿠와앙!!","source_cn":"吼嗷嗷！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x876268DCB55CDDA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120531008:1":{"text":"페토가 새들이 불쌍하대요…","source_cn":"帕托，觉得鸟儿很可怜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404FD486B4D1EC89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120531009:1":{"text":"새장, 싫어! 먹을 게 없어, 싫어! 집에 갈 수 없어, 너무 싫어!!","source_cn":"笼子，讨厌！没东西吃，讨厌！不能回家，非常讨厌！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0B891B924824A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120531010:1":{"text":"이 물새들의 서식지는 유적의 산이에요. 그곳의 환경은 따뜻하고 습해서, 덥고 건조한 침식된 영토와는 전혀 달라요.","source_cn":"这些水鸟的原生地在遗迹群山，那里的环境温和潮湿，和酷热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90EF95C4B463C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120531011:1":{"text":"그리고 허니리프베어랑은 다르게 적응력도 부족해서, 아마 이곳까지 오느라 체력이 바닥났을 거예요.","source_cn":"它们和叶角熊不一样，适应力很差，一路颠簸来到这里，估计...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BF5359D68BF4B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120531012:1":{"text":"…안 돼, 얘네들을 이곳에 남겨두면 안 돼요! 그럼 페토보다 더 불쌍해진단 말이에요!","source_cn":"……不，它们不能留在这里！会比帕托更可怜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4A41FE7C627A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120531013:1":{"text":"얘네들이 원래 어디에 있었는지 아시나요? 얘네들을 집까지 데려다 주면 안 돼요? ","source_cn":"你们知道它们原来在哪里？拜托，送它们回家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA726D03C2D085163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120531014:0":{"text":"우오…","source_cn":"呜嗷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ABE0B88D16740C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1120531014":{"text":"우오…","source_cn":"呜嗷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ABE0B88D16740C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120531015:3":{"text":"걱정 마요, 카이. 우리가 꼭 이 물새들을 집까지 데려다 줄게요. 이건 기사로서의 약속이에요!","source_cn":"放心吧，卡卡，我们一定会把这些水鸟送回家，这是骑士的诺言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE47FD6F44BBDC522","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120531016:0":{"text":"쿠와앙!!","source_cn":"呜嗷嗷！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B0561103EBA41C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120531017:1":{"text":"여러분, 정말 좋은 사람이에요! 페토와 카이도 여러분이 좋아요!","source_cn":"你们是大好人！帕托和卡卡，喜欢你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A98F23A5A7AB8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120531018:1":{"text":"페토, 웃어! 자유야! 물새들이 자유로워졌어!","source_cn":"笑吧，帕托！自由了！大家都自由了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71B3203B6E56D0F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"알겠어, 내게 맡겨","source_cn":"没问题，交给我吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x52556AC12562624F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"알겠어, 내게 맡겨","female":"알겠어, 내게 맡겨","variant_male_record_index":"64290","variant_female_record_index":"64291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu